        "desc": "<p>雕刻成花型的聖物，似乎是為了象徵某種如花般綻放的可怖存在。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/01/25c4512875bad223765a5a32c82b09a4_7122872897984003318.png",
